{
  "id": "ch02_s08_shuge",
  "chapter": 2,
  "act": 2,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "xujinghe",
    "peizhaoye",
    "liqinghe",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "女冠校读正式给俸并限差务，同时把调笺授权摆到台前",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "粮袋放妥，你回书阁和公主核这一趟脚程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "案上金纹压着旧算筹，李令仪将最短的一根挑出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l3",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这半日工钱，是从什么时候算的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l4",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你问的是这半日工钱？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l5",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原先只算进署到出署。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l6",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我从观里来，光等入门就多半个时辰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l7",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就漏了她在门外等的时辰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l8",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不能叫她白等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l9",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一同查清，别凭我猜时辰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_check_supply": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "护袋的布找到了，补领的凭据也在。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_check_supply": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先记下这一笔已经补齐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_check_route": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "还漏了卸袋那一段路，往返的钱没算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_check_route": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把这段也添上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_check_declined": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "另请人查过了。路上花多久、东西缺什么，已经分开写。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_check_declined": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两笔都记，别漏掉一头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.adi_pay_advance": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "九件工钱已付清。刷栏杆改到下旬，人也告知了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.adi_pay_advance": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "到下旬还得照办。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.adi_pay_original": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "六件的钱付了，另三件正在催，今夜等回话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.adi_pay_original": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "余下三件仍记作欠款。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.adi_pay_original": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "催款跑的工夫也别漏算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l21",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这笔也列，别只让我看省下的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l22",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日核卷可以，明日病舍的药不能也等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l23",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "明日……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l24",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这里只请你校读、验封。别的差事，还得另问你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l25",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l26",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是来一次付一次，还是连往返算半日？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l27",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "按次付能省钱，可每回路上花多少工夫，都得记。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l28",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "记路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l29",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "按半日付，少记几笔；没做满半日，也照付。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l30",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两种我都能接。做满半日，我就得回观里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l31",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l32",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐简揭开另一只匣。封笺还未拆，旁边夹着调令。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l33",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这封是给我的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l34",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "沈司记交的，和调卷回执同送，在待发匣。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l35",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "怎么会——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l36",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封信先扣住了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l37",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l38",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "太后下了调取旧案的命令，连外封写案号的往来信也要取。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l39",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "母亲请祖母查旧案。今夜公议，会把这道命令拿出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l40",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是谁准的、准取哪些，让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l41",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她展开委牒，唐简指给你看案号与签发处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l42",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只验了外封，还没拆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l43",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "里头的私话……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l44",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l45",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也要读？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l46",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "眼下只说调取，没说哪些能当众念。到席上还得问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l47",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把反对的话也记下。拿到了信，不等于信里什么都能读。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l48",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "记下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l49",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐简在封簿旁写了一行，笺仍留在匣中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l50",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先把许静和这半日的工钱定下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.l51",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你将许静和的俸钱记在算筹旁。"
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.cA",
      "text": "连往返按半日给俸",
      "effects": {
        "affinity.liqinghe": 3,
        "affinity.peizhaoye": 2,
        "flag.liqinghe_cost_check": true,
        "flag.nvguan_halfday_pay": true
      },
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch02_s09_shishe"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s08_shuge.cB",
      "text": "按次给俸，往返另记",
      "effects": {
        "affinity.liqinghe": 3,
        "affinity.peizhaoye": 2,
        "flag.liqinghe_cost_check": true,
        "flag.nvguan_trip_pay": true
      },
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch02_s09_shishe"
    }
  ]
}
